# Fights for physics timing at the wide river east of the castle (the scene
# that reached 7-13 fps): from a save with the sword, east along the moat's
# river to its bank, then swing in every direction for ~30 s. Needs a save
# past the sword; seed it with SAVES=. tests/phys_frames.py reads the trace.
log TitleMovie 120
sleep 5
press START
sleep 3
press START
sleep 5
press CROSS
sleep 15
hold RIGHT 4
hold DOWN 1.5
hold RIGHT 3
hold RIGHT 4
hold RIGHT 4
hold RIGHT 2.5
hold UP 1.5
hold RIGHT 2
shot river

hold RIGHT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold DOWN 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold LEFT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold UP 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold RIGHT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold DOWN 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold LEFT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold UP 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold RIGHT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold DOWN 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold LEFT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold UP 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold RIGHT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold DOWN 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold LEFT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold UP 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold RIGHT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold DOWN 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold LEFT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold UP 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold RIGHT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold DOWN 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold LEFT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold UP 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold RIGHT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold DOWN 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold LEFT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold UP 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold RIGHT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold DOWN 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold LEFT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold UP 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
shot end
sleep 10
